What is the time complexity of this function?

```js
function hasDuplicatePair(arr) {
  for (let i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
    for (let j = i + 1; j < arr.length; j++) {
      if (arr[i] === arr[j]) return true;
    }
  }
  return false;
}
```

